      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability — extracting expected strings into named variables and splitting long assertions across readable lines.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version extracts the long expected strings into clearly named constants (`DEFAULT_VISIBILITY_STRING` and `NO_OVERRIDES_STRING`), breaking each into one line per field so readers can immediately see what visibility setting each accessor uses without parsing a dense inline concatenation."
